aligned}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 6 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 6 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316977/field-1" "q-316977/field-2" "q-316977/field-3" "q-316977/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316977"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75511/selection/8f3bfada506465a5ef64a07def23c58a8e39c13a12f02642a4971bde94f48554" :answer/id #uuid "14eda18f-60c4-5bb6-89b2-943492d84cd5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=-2,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75511/selection/b2448e315581d8cb65baa908fc1cb0a84ed1d0b9e72c138661461469ad467de7" :answer/id #uuid "0517588e-0f70-5423-9db8-538db2d43645" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=3,\\,c=2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75511/selection/7a3d5cb9ca2996ed910ec4b5eeddadb685ec3400e544ec1dd793ece08bca083a" :answer/id #uuid "b31de5b2-7a6d-5062-bc51-42b00b7f4177" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=3,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75511/selection/a13f050cf31fd42807b986e139c01c625e6de761fc4e38302871da2b035fe60b" :answer/id #uuid "7df89ebb-28ee-54be-a430-77ab0082f724" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=2,\\,c=2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75511/selection/b2c129f819166429fd89edca60fc520f440740650430ae1661eeeff8b0fadb8c" :answer/id #uuid "c629a8e5-fc5f-5681-bd3e-17233c46dd63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=-2,\\,c=2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75511/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9cab7092-514d-569a-a3cb-86ddcdbf4c54" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75511/selection/b2c129f819166429fd89edca60fc520f440740650430ae1661eeeff8b0fadb8c" :answer-field/choices ["q-75511/selection/8f3bfada506465a5ef64a07def23c58a8e39c13a12f02642a4971bde94f48554" "q-75511/selection/b2448e315581d8cb65baa908fc1cb0a84ed1d0b9e72c138661461469ad467de7" "q-75511/selection/7a3d5cb9ca2996ed910ec4b5eeddadb685ec3400e544ec1dd793ece08bca083a" "q-75511/selection/a13f050cf31fd42807b986e139c01c625e6de761fc4e38302871da2b035fe60b" "q-75511/selection/b2c129f819166429fd89edca60fc520f440740650430ae1661eeeff8b0fadb8c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75511" :question/id #uuid "2fb4b6fc-e7f5-535e-a41e-aecc915867f4" :question/math-academy-id "q-75511" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2x+y+z=-1 \\\\ z+3x-2y=3 \\\\ -y+2z-x=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & b & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & c\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2x+y+z=-1 \\\\ 3x-2y+z=3 \\\\ -x-y+2z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-1,\\,b=-2,\\,c=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75511/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75511"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130562/selection/146808a685e4a0fd402b02ad003565bf3667b41a90a99985cb82afa88c7b0f2b" :answer/id #uuid "ea142ec8-5dd7-5a9b-9e06-dcdb6db57742" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=5,\\,c=8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130562/selection/7bd5c577da0ec1070c6c69ca0699bcf1568308fe72e8f3b6ecdbf97a3f77d153" :answer/id #uuid "1df6607c-5133-5d94-85c7-8a04d4fab857" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=1,\\,c=6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130562/selection/4bbe7b6ba2261b6f9dfe09fffc11ee367531c351a7790637b064bffcb8466803" :answer/id #uuid "df0ca58e-cc2e-51e6-91ce-63f4ad40ee6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-7,\\,b=1,\\,c=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130562/selection/e7b7286d5e2c5c81acf822a71d9b0b8776b6be2afe0e53bc0137256a7500893f" :answer/id #uuid "02238340-e005-5423-8044-8e5905140f02" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-7,\\,c=8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130562/selection/31e5b26399c4e237b2932d95562308a269af963e8aa486c214bdf8810a454ac1" :answer/id #uuid "25e57de6-3fc4-5fa7-af00-5f628060c8a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=4,\\,b=1,\\,c=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130562/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "247f7b3a-42e3-5c20-a1dc-8036e2c18eba" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130562/selection/7bd5c577da0ec1070c6c69ca0699bcf1568308fe72e8f3b6ecdbf97a3f77d153" :answer-field/choices ["q-130562/selection/146808a685e4a0fd402b02ad003565bf3667b41a90a99985cb82afa88c7b0f2b" "q-130562/selection/7bd5c577da0ec1070c6c69ca0699bcf1568308fe72e8f3b6ecdbf97a3f77d153" "q-130562/selection/4bbe7b6ba2261b6f9dfe09fffc11ee367531c351a7790637b064bffcb8466803" "q-130562/selection/e7b7286d5e2c5c81acf822a71d9b0b8776b6be2afe0e53bc0137256a7500893f" "q-130562/selection/31e5b26399c4e237b2932d95562308a269af963e8aa486c214bdf8810a454ac1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130562" :question/id #uuid "f48fae54-75c1-5735-95b2-656baa979098" :question/math-academy-id "q-130562" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}z-7x-5=0 \\\\ 4y-x-3z-2=0 \\\\ 2y+x-8=-2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & a \\\\ b & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ c\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b,$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-7x+0y+z=5 \\\\ -x+4y-3z=2 \\\\ x+2y+0z=6\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-3,\\,b=1,\\,c=6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130562/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130562"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75501/selection/e98564555ec4c26bc6ea8d60bbedf50063fdb8aaacf6bc0c7803a532758dff50" :answer/id #uuid "b1fc01a3-ba13-53d6-baea-5bbefed62ffd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=7,\\,c=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75501/selection/2f76d6bae3605cfbacf34ac03a8d23a4abe3f0ae13f23b565fa75d86c3f8e121" :answer/id #uuid "79d631a6-35af-52c3-9f71-b3d77d196ff1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-2,\\,c=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75501/selection/307e24e699409c04e18df017e2d07305cc3cc09895b322d16c90880ca8168277" :answer/id #uuid "002f5a7f-bdee-5584-9267-990d5e06cd36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=5,\\,b=7,\\,c=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75501/selection/0aa8f3268cfb485aa586632273338fe0caf6136b7aae565c5335f77cc56e80f3" :answer/id #uuid "c40ca1b0-67c1-561c-a22a-9a93dfd65436" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=5,\\,b=7,\\,c=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75501/selection/d3540f6606d695f7cb61d13c2c48f54f34dbbc5672d2f29aeb900170dec04d91" :answer/id #uuid "91dc011f-db8a-53eb-b3f0-e6008cc2e9cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-2,\\,c=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75501/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "60dd77f0-6d94-51ef-8243-34d4f987d473" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75501/selection/2f76d6bae3605cfbacf34ac03a8d23a4abe3f0ae13f23b565fa75d86c3f8e121" :answer-field/choices ["q-75501/selection/e98564555ec4c26bc6ea8d60bbedf50063fdb8aaacf6bc0c7803a532758dff50" "q-75501/selection/2f76d6bae3605cfbacf34ac03a8d23a4abe3f0ae13f23b565fa75d86c3f8e121" "q-75501/selection/307e24e699409c04e18df017e2d07305cc3cc09895b322d16c90880ca8168277" "q-75501/selection/0aa8f3268cfb485aa586632273338fe0caf6136b7aae565c5335f77cc56e80f3" "q-75501/selection/d3540f6606d695f7cb61d13c2c48f54f34dbbc5672d2f29aeb900170dec04d91"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75501" :question/id #uuid "c7bbe001-db69-5932-b577-7365e9bf59b0" :question/math-academy-id "q-75501" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5y-3z+x=2 \\\\ 3z+7x-2y=5 \\\\ 2x-2y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & 5 & -3 \\\\ 7 & b & 3 \\\\ 2 & -2 & c\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x+5y-3z=2 \\\\ 7x-2y+3z=5 \\\\ 2x-2y+0z=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 7 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 7 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=1,\\,b=-2,\\,c=0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75501/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75501"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75490/selection/91afc2a9bdeb1acc0f5df97d9abd2c1c6b881c2adbd0d07292e2c15721ea808a" :answer/id #uuid "cbde8509-210d-5fc0-bb19-3f232d3afe82" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=0,\\,c=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75490/selection/e0fdbdaf745de5f38266002541d605e9407473fef17454d53f9f96b855858d85" :answer/id #uuid "af7791f2-c22b-5ab3-acbc-af400f2443ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=1,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75490/selection/9cd0d25dd76c6e1e4c475072c93065c779a02c57df7de18ef519671bb777a97b" :answer/id #uuid "e5ba78a4-e97a-5eea-a942-6f5134e65120" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=5,\\,b=-6,\\,c=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75490/selection/127dbb0671fb8b658a6a006d2158fef93698cbfc274a1044cc4b7ee789769a7a" :answer/id #uuid "538fbde5-1162-5daf-8bd0-e7ccef9d69fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=0,\\,c=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75490/selection/f3eecf1d003252a1f70413a1281708187b0d47f246f3f437b6ad4dc2b1394928" :answer/id #uuid "560503e3-a79a-59b9-b5cc-8f1f89efc477" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a=2,\\,b=-6,\\,c=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75490/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "98b457cf-955c-5930-a516-c09b245c49d8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75490/selection/91afc2a9bdeb1acc0f5df97d9abd2c1c6b881c2adbd0d07292e2c15721ea808a" :answer-field/choices ["q-75490/selection/91afc2a9bdeb1acc0f5df97d9abd2c1c6b881c2adbd0d07292e2c15721ea808a" "q-75490/selection/e0fdbdaf745de5f38266002541d605e9407473fef17454d53f9f96b855858d85" "q-75490/selection/9cd0d25dd76c6e1e4c475072c93065c779a02c57df7de18ef519671bb777a97b" "q-75490/selection/127dbb0671fb8b658a6a006d2158fef93698cbfc274a1044cc4b7ee789769a7a" "q-75490/selection/f3eecf1d003252a1f70413a1281708187b0d47f246f3f437b6ad4dc2b1394928"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-75490" :question/id #uuid "878ded7e-cbaa-5e72-af33-efae3a58cd80" :question/math-academy-id "q-75490" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2y+5x=3z+2 \\\\ 3x-6y=5 \\\\ 2x-3y+5z=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & a & -3 \\\\ 3 & -6 & b \\\\ 2 & c & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5x+2y-3z=2 \\\\ 3x-6y+0z=5 \\\\ 2x-3y+5z=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=2,\\,b=0,\\,c=-3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75490/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75490"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75512/selection/32c16b2eea005352e264451f2ef82fd77e9f0aa39196b2800e1ab444bc29bf88" :answer/id #uuid "18f9f8f7-0fb